Name: UKCP18 Local climate projections
Description: A set of 16 high resolution convection-permitting climate projections for the UK from 1981-2080, for the RCP8.5 emissions scenario, driven by the regional climate model projections. The dataset also includes FUTURE-DRAINAGE rainfall uplifts derived from UKCP18 Local. The data is available on a 2.2km grid on a rotated pole at various temporal resolutions: hourly (for some variables), 3-hourly (for some variables), daily and longer averages. Additionally, a version of the data has been re-gridded onto a 5km grid on the Ordnance Survey's British National Grid. The data has been converted to cloud-optimised Zarr v3 data stores.
